  "fixture": "g19 seeds the Masjid and Thursday 10:00. The Arrival branch reaches 18:15 through its choices and is captured with the real wallet. The zero-coin fixture reproduces the g25–g29 HUD. The post-meeting Masjid check completes Maghrib through the clock model.",
